<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#FFF8F0">
<title>思潼AI商城（科技感升级版 demo）</title>
<!--
  ============================================================
  /agents 首页科技感升级 demo · v3.0（20260925）
  设计定位：保留线上商城信息结构（搜索/金刚区/楼层/商品卡）与电商亮色风格，
  品牌橙主色调贯穿全页，在商城感之上加科技感点缀：
  暖白底 + 橙色氛围光 + 橙金神经网络粒子 + 白卡流光描边。
  核心新增：
  ① 首次登入 5 步动态教学（AI 管家「小潼」+ spotlight 移动高亮 + 搜索框模拟打字）
  ② 右上角 ▶ 一键自动演示（自动逛楼层 → 开员工卡 → 模拟对话开场 → 算力扣减动画）
  ③ 全页局部动态：神经网络粒子背景 / 头像能量环 / 卡片流光描边 /
     Hero 打字机轮播 / 音频波形 / 扫光按钮 / 数字滚动 / 滚动显现
  演示数据虚构（算力为演示值，正式以线上价目表为准；使用智能体按次扣算力，1 元 = 10 算力，余额不足需先充值）。
  v3.12（20260926）：AI案例 Tab 升级为手机端信息流页面——12 个「别人怎么用 AI 降本增效」
  案例卡（扁平风封面图 + 前后指标对比 + 启发点），品类筛选 chips、滚动分批加载、
  点卡片看完整改造过程（卡点 / 3 步做法 / 投入 / 结果），每条案例「⚡ 用同款」直达
  商城对应数字员工弹层或商品货架（图文带智能体，对标带货视频的引流模式）。
  v3.1（20260925）：8 位数字员工换回原版头像（jpg base64 内嵌）；
  AI 管家小潼可点击对话（快捷问题 + 关键词应答）；手机端优先、桌面端增强。
  单文件零外链：双击可开、微信可直发。
  ============================================================
  v3.29（20260927）UX 走查修复批：
  ① hero 副标体现「AI 商城」大定位（智能体/数字员工/AI硬件/AI课程，不止智能体商城/数字员工/助手）
  ② hero 副标下加算力换算微注（1 元 = 10 算力 · 0 元开通 · 用后扣费 · 失败不扣）
  ③ 新手帮助弹层 helpMask（术语词典：算力/积分旧称/访谈/简报/0元开通·用后扣费/交付才扣/失败不扣费/赠送算力）
     入口：meView「❓ 新手帮助」+ hero-cta「❓ 新手帮助」+ 充值弹层「❓ 什么是算力？」
-->
<style>
:root{
  --bg0:#FFFFFF; --bg1:#FFFFFF; --bg2:#FFF6EC;
  --card:#FFFFFF; --card2:#FFF9F2;
  --line:#F0EBE3; --line2:#E5DDD1;
  --ink:#2B1B10; --sub:#94796B; --dim:#BEA488;
  --orange:#FF6A00; --orange2:#F25300; --orangeSoft:rgba(255,106,0,.12);
  --cyan:#E8862B; --green:#12A06A; --amber:#F59E0B; --purple:#E8A33D; --gold:#F5B04A;
  --r:16px;
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{
  font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;
  background:
    radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 85% -10%, rgba(255,150,60,.15), transparent 60%),
    radial-gradient(1000px 520px at -10% 12%, rgba(255,106,0,.10), transparent 55%),
    linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg0), var(--bg1) 46%, var(--bg0));
  color:var(--ink); font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; min-height:100vh;
  overflow-x:hidden;
}
button{font-family:inherit;border:0;cursor:pointer;background:none;color:inherit}
input{font-family:inherit;color:inherit}
::selection{background:rgba(255,122,26,.35)}

/* ========== 背景层 ========== */
#bg-net{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0;opacity:.9;pointer-events:none}
#bg-grid{
  position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0;pointer-events:none;
  background:
    linear-gradient(rgba(255,140,60,.07) 1px, transparent 1px) 0 0/44px 44px,
    linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,140,60,.07) 1px, transparent 1px) 0 0/44px 44px;
  -webkit-mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse 90% 60% at 50% 0%, #000 30%, transparent 75%);
  mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse 90% 60% at 50% 0%, #000 30%, transparent 75%);
}
#cursor-glow{
  position:fixed;z-index:1;width:420px;height:420px;border-radius:50%;pointer-events:none;
  background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,122,26,.07), transparent 60%);
  transform:translate(-50%,-50%);transition:left .18s ease-out, top .18s ease-out;display:none;
}

/* ========== 顶栏 ========== */
.topbar{
  position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;
  padding:10px 14px; padding-top:calc(10px + env(safe-area-inset-top));
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(16px);backdrop-filter:blur(16px);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;min-width:0}
.brand-txt{display:flex;flex-direction:column;line-height:1.25;min-width:0}
.brand-txt b{font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.5px;white-space:nowrap}
.brand-txt span{font-size:10px;color:var(--dim);white-space:nowrap}
.ai-status{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:10px;color:var(--green)}
.ai-status i{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(46,219,139,.6);animation:breathDot 2s infinite}
@keyframes breathDot{0%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(46,219,139,.55)}70%{box-shadow:0 0 0 7px rgba(46,219,139,0)}100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(46,219,139,0)}}
.topbar .sp{flex:1}
#wallet{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.bal{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#E86A00;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,106,0,.10);border:1px solid rgba(255,122,26,.35);white-space:nowrap}
.bal.flash{animation:balFlash .9s}
@keyframes balFlash{0%,100%{background:rgba(255,122,26,.10)}30%{background:rgba(255,122,26,.42);box-shadow:0 0 16px rgba(255,122,26,.5)}}
.mini-btn{
  position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:34px;padding:6px 13px;border-radius:10px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;
  color:#fff;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FF8A2A,#F25300);
  box-shadow:0 3px 14px rgba(255,106,0,.35);white-space:nowrap;
}
.mini-btn::after{
  content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:-70%;width:45%;height:100%;
  background:linear-gradient(105deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,.5), transparent);
  animation:sheen 2.8s infinite;
}
@keyframes sheen{0%{left:-70%}55%{left:130%}100%{left:130%}}
.icon-btn{
  width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:15px;flex:none;
  background:#FFF4E6;border:1px solid var(--line2);color:var(--sub);
}
#demoBtn{background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,138,42,.18),rgba(255,92,0,.22));border-color:rgba(255,122,26,.5);color:#E86A00;box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(255,106,0,.22)}
#demoBtn.on{color:#F25300;border-color:rgba(255,122,26,.9)}

/* ========== 主内容 ========== */
.page{position:relative;z-index:5;max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:14px 14px 90px}
@media(min-width:960px){ body{padding-left:190px} .page{padding:22px 22px 60px} }

/* ---- Hero AI 指挥横幅 ---- */
.hero{
  position:relative;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;padding:20px 18px;
  background:linear-gradient(140deg,#FF8A2A 0%,#FF6A00 55%,#F25300 100%);
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);
  box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(255,106,0,.25);
}
.hero::before{
  content:"";position:absolute;inset:-1px;border-radius:21px;pointer-events:none;
  background:linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(255,255,255,.85), rgba(255,220,150,.65), rgba(255,255,255,.25), rgba(255,200,120,.6));
  background-size:300% 300%;animation:borderFlow 9s linear infinite;
  -webkit-mask:linear-gradient(#000 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#000 0 0);
  -webkit-mask-composite:xor;mask-composite:exclude;padding:1px;
}
@keyframes borderFlow{0%{background-position:0% 0%}50%{background-position:100% 100%}100%{background-position:0% 0%}}
.hero-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.hero-ava{
  position:relative;width:52px;height:52px;flex:none;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:24px;
  background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 25%, #FFFFFF, #FFE9D2);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.7);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(255,255,255,.22), 0 0 18px rgba(120,40,0,.28);
}
.hero-ava::after{content:"";position:absolute;width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:50%;border:1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,.7);animation:spin 9s linear infinite}
.hero-ava::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:-5px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.55);animation:avaPulse 2.2s infinite;pointer-events:none}
@keyframes avaPulse{0%{transform:scale(.92);opacity:.85}70%{transform:scale(1.28);opacity:0}100%{transform:scale(1.28);opacity:0}}
.ava-tip{
  position:absolute;bottom:-12px;right:-16px;white-space:nowrap;font-style:normal;
  font-size:10px;font-weight:800;color:#B35400;background:#FFE9B8;
  padding:4px 8px;border-radius:2px 10px 10px 10px;box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(120,40,0,.35);
  animation:tipBounce 1.6s infinite;pointer-events:none;z-index:2;
}
@keyframes tipBounce{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}50%{transform:translateY(-4px)}}
@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
.hero-main{min-width:0;flex:1}
.hero-tag{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:10px;color:#FFE9CF;letter-spacing:1px}
.hero-tag .wave{display:inline-flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:2px;height:12px}
.hero-tag .wave i{width:3px;background:#FFF3E0;border-radius:2px;animation:wv 1s infinite}
.hero-tag .wave i:nth-child(1){height:6px}.hero-tag .wave i:nth-child(2){height:11px;animation-delay:.15s}
.hero-tag .wave i:nth-child(3){height:4px;animation-delay:.3s}.hero-tag .wave i:nth-child(4){height:9px;animation-delay:.45s}
.hero-tag .wave i:nth-child(5){height:5px;animation-delay:.6s}
@keyframes wv{0%,100%{transform:scaleY(.4)}50%{transform:scaleY(1.15)}}
.hero-title{font-size:17px;font-weight:800;margin:4px 0 2px;letter-spacing:.5px;color:#FFF}
.hero-title em{font-style:normal;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#FFF0C8,#FFC66B);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent}
.hero-type{font-size:12.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.92);min-height:20px}
.hero-type b{color:#FFE9B8;font-weight:600}
.hero-slogan{margin-top:9px;font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.95);background:rgba(255,255,255,.16);display:inline-block;padding:5px 11px;border-radius:99px;letter-spacing:.5px}
.hero-note{margin-top:9px;font-size:10.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.72);letter-spacing:.3px}
.help-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin:12px 0 4px}
.help-item{background:#FFF9F1;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;text-align:left}
.help-item b{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink)}
.help-item span{font-size:12px;color:var(--sub);line-height:1.55}
.caret{display:inline-block;width:7px;height:14px;background:#FFF;vertical-align:-2px;margin-left:2px;animation:blink .8s step-end infinite}
@keyframes blink{50%{opacity:0}}
.hero-cta{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.big-btn{
  position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:44px;padding:11px 20px;border-radius:12px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FF8A2A,#F24E00);box-shadow:0 6px 22px rgba(255,106,0,.4);
}
.big-btn::after{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:-70%;width:45%;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(105deg,transparent,rgba(255,255,255,.55),transparent);animation:sheen 3.2s infinite}
.hero-cta .big-btn{background:#FFF;color:#F25300;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(120,40,0,.22)}
.ghost-btn{min-height:44px;padding:11px 18px;border-radius:12px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--sub);background:#FFF9F2;border:1px solid var(--line2)}
.hero-cta .ghost-btn{color:#FFF;background:rgba(255,255,255,.2);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.6)}

/* ---- 搜索 ---- */
.searchbar{margin-top:14px;position:relative}
.search{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:11px 14px;border-radius:13px;
  background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid var(--line);
  box-shadow:0 3px 14px rgba(200,120,50,.08);
  transition:border .3s, box-shadow .3s;
}
.search:focus-within{border-color:rgba(255,140,50,.55);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(255,140,50,.12), 0 0 22px rgba(255,106,0,.15)}
.search svg{flex:none;opacity:.55}
.search input{flex:1;background:none;border:0;outline:0;font-size:16px;color:var(--ink);min-width:0}
.search input::placeholder{color:var(--dim)}
.search-clear{width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:#F5E8D8;color:var(--sub);font-size:13px;flex:none}
.search-hint{font-size:11px;color:var(--dim);margin-top:7px;padding-left:4px}
.search-hint b{color:#E8710F;font-weight:600}
#result-count{display:none;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--sub);margin:12px 2px 0}
#result-count b{color:var(--orange)}

/* ---- 金刚区 ---- */
.ad-banner{position:relative;margin-top:14px;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff}
.ad-track{display:flex;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;scrollbar-width:none}
.ad-track::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
.ad-slide{flex:0 0 100%;scroll-snap-align:start;height:92px;display:grid;place-items:center}
.ad-inv{width:calc(100% - 16px);height:76px;border-radius:12px;border:0;padding:0 16px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FF8C32,#F25300 60%,#E84B00);color:#fff;text-align:left;box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(242,83,0,.25)}
.ad-inv-txt b{display:block;font-size:15.5px;font-weight:800}
.ad-inv-txt small{display:block;font-size:11px;opacity:.92;margin-top:2px}
.ad-inv-go{flex:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;background:rgba(255,255,255,.2);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);border-radius:15px;padding:6px 12px;white-space:nowrap}
.ad-inv:active{transform:scale(.97)}
.kingkong{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:7px;margin-top:16px}
.kk{
  position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:13px 4px 10px;border-radius:15px;
  background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(8px);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
  transition:transform .25s, border .25s;
}
.kk:active{transform:scale(.94)}
@media(hover:hover){.kk:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:var(--kk-tint)}}
.kk-ico{
  position:relative;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:14px;display:grid;place-items:center;
  background:linear-gradient(150deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--kk-tint) 52%, white) 0%, var(--kk-tint) 46%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--kk-tint) 62%, #5B1E00) 100%);
  border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--kk-tint) 50%, white);
  box-shadow:0 7px 16px color-mix(in srgb, var(--kk-tint) 40%, transparent), inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,.6), inset 0 -3px 5px color-mix(in srgb, var(--kk-tint) 55%, rgba(0,0,0,.25));
  animation:kkBreath 3.2s infinite;
}
.kk-ico::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:2px;right:2px;top:2px;height:44%;border-radius:12px 12px 9px 9px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,.55),rgba(255,255,255,.05));pointer-events:none;z-index:2}
.kk-ico::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:-5px;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--kk-tint) 30%, transparent);opacity:.5;animation:kkRing 3.2s infinite}
.kk-ico img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:inherit;display:block}
.kk-ico svg{width:25px;height:25px;stroke:#fff;fill:none;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;filter:drop-shadow(0 1px 1.5px rgba(0,0,0,.22));position:relative;z-index:1}
@keyframes kkBreath{0%,100%{box-shadow:0 7px 14px color-mix(in srgb, var(--kk-tint) 35%, transparent), inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,.6), inset 0 -3px 5px color-mix(in srgb, var(--kk-tint) 55%, rgba(0,0,0,.25))}50%{box-shadow:0 7px 24px color-mix(in srgb, var(--kk-tint) 62%, transparent), inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,.6), inset 0 -3px 5px color-mix(in srgb, var(--kk-tint) 55%, rgba(0,0,0,.25))}}
@keyframes kkRing{0%,100%{transform:scale(1);opacity:.4}50%{transform:scale(1.08);opacity:.1}}
.kk span{font-size:10px;color:var(--sub);white-space:nowrap;letter-spacing:-.2px}
.kk.pulse .kk-ico{animation:kkPulse .5s 3}
@keyframes kkPulse{50%{transform:scale(1.18)}}

/* ---- 今日任务 ---- */
.today{margin-top:16px}
.t-row{display:flex;gap:10px;overflow-x:auto;padding-bottom:4px;scrollbar-width:none}
.t-row::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
.t-card{
  flex:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:14px;min-width:250px;
  background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);text-align:left;
  transition:transform .25s, border .25s, box-shadow .25s;
}
@media(hover:hover){.t-card:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);border-color:rgba(255,122,26,.5);box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(255,106,0,.15)}}
.t-ico{width:38px;height:38px;flex:none;border-radius:11px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:18px;background:rgba(255,140,50,.12);border:1px solid rgba(255,140,50,.35)}
.t-main{min-width:0;flex:1}
.t-title{font-size:13px;font-weight:700}
.t-hint{font-size:11px;color:var(--sub);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;display:block}
.t-go{color:var(--orange);font-size:18px;flex:none}
.t-card.spotlight{border-color:var(--orange);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(255,122,26,.3), 0 0 26px rgba(255,106,0,.4)}
.spotlight{border-color:var(--orange) !important;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(255,122,26,.35), 0 0 26px rgba(255,106,0,.45) !important}

/* ---- 楼层 ---- */
.floor{margin-top:26px}
.floor-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:9px;margin-bottom:12px}
.floor-no{
  font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--orange);
  padding:3px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:rgba(255,122,26,.12);border:1px solid rgba(255,122,26,.3);
}
.floor-title{font-size:16px;font-weight:800}
.floor-sub{font-size:11px;color:var(--dim)}
.floor-live{margin-left:auto;font-size:10px;color:var(--green);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px}
.floor-live i{width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);animation:breathDot 2s infinite}

/* ---- 员工卡 ---- */
.emps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:11px}
@media(min-width:640px){.emps{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
@media(min-width:960px){.emps{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}}
@media(min-width:1180px){.emps{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}}
.emp{
  position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;padding:14px;border-radius:var(--r);
  background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(10px);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
  overflow:hidden;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;
  transition:transform .28s, border .28s, box-shadow .28s;
  opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px);
}
.emp.in{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}
@media(hover:hover){.emp:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);border-color:rgba(255,122,26,.45);box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(170,90,20,.16), 0 0 24px rgba(255,106,0,.12)}}
.emp::before{
  content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:-100%;width:60%;height:2px;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--orange),transparent);
  animation:topFlow 3.6s infinite;
}
